# Paths whose changes need a human approval from the OTHER teammate before merge.
# GitHub enforces this once scripts/setup_repo_rules.sh --apply has created the main-branch ruleset
# ("require review from code owners"); until then scripts/pr_ready.py enforces it for agents;
# a PR author's own approval never counts, so listing both owners means "the other person".
# scripts/pr_ready.py reads this file too: the [experiment] / [gate] section markers below
# decide which extra evidence it demands. Keep the markers and use only simple patterns
# (/file, /dir/, /dir/*.ext).

